> = What is Freenet? = 
> 
> Freenet is software created by the folks at the [http://freenetproject.org Freenet Project] that is designed to use encrypted network nodes to allow people to safely and anonymously retrieve and send information around the Internet. For more information, take a look at their [http://freenetproject.org/index.php?page=whatis What is Freenet?] page.
